msgid "Allowed (GLPI default behavior)"
msgstr "Diizinkan (perilaku default GLPI)"

msgid "Block solution approval when there is a comment"
msgstr "Blokir persetujuan solusi saat ada komentar"

msgid "Comments during solution approval"
msgstr "Komentar selama persetujuan solusi"

msgid "Configuration saved successfully."
msgstr "Konfigurasi berhasil disimpan."

msgid "Error saving configuration."
msgstr "Kesalahan saat menyimpan konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"It is not allowed to enter comments when approving a solution. Please leave "
"the text box empty or refuse the solution."
msgstr ""
"Tidak diizinkan memasukkan komentar saat menyetujui solusi. Kosongkan kotak "
"teks atau tolak solusi."

msgid "Show warning to the user, allowing the solution approval"
msgstr "Tampilkan peringatan kepada pengguna, izinkan persetujuan"

msgid "Solution Approval Guard"
msgstr "Penjaga Persetujuan Solusi"

msgid "Solution Approval Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Persetujuan Solusi"

msgid "Solution approved"
msgstr "Solusi disetujui"

msgid ""
"Warning: Your solution was approved, but to report pending issues you must "
"refuse the solution or open a new ticket."
msgstr ""
"Peringatan: Solusi Anda disetujui, tetapi untuk melaporkan masalah yang "
"tertunda, Anda harus menolak solusi atau membuka tiket baru."
